f]+\\\\gamma^{p'}_{\\\\rm LL}[\\\\mathbf f]\\\\gamma^p_{\\\\rm LL}[\\\\mathbf \
f]=2N_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\mathbf f_p,\\\\mathbf f_{p'})\\\\,\\\\mathsf 1_4$; for \
