ExpressionUUID->"5561f6e3-b451-4619-a840-cf7fd027ffb4"],

Cell["Part II. The encyclopedia of the programs of Test 2", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"0bc6987d-bb3b-4da7-badc-e028054e2591"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Part II rewrites, in the Wolfram Language, every program of Test 2 of the \
super-loop revision, with every check of the original programs. Test 2 asks \
eleven questions (items [1] to [11]): the field equations of a \
self-interacting spinor field on the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"3", "+", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9c986d51-27b6-4b84-9b5e-a489e4085f6a"],
 " manifold of the super-loop (item [1]), their analysis and analytic \
solutions (item [2]), a solver of the field equations and a plotter of its \
solutions (items [3] to [6], written in Python and in Rust), and the \
construction and the physics of the superfluid boson singlet state, SFBS \
(items [7] to [11]). The original programs are a library and six programs in \
Rust (the library t2core and the programs t2_fields, t2_analytic, t2_solve, \
t2_plot and t2_sfbs) and five programs in Python. Every chapter of Part II \
names the original files that it rewrites, and every check keeps the name \
that it has in the original report (GS-1 to GS-16, AS-1 to AS-10, EX-1 to \
EX-8, SB-1 to SB-17, and the self-tests)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b24a018f-d3f3-4476-85e8-50a7966357f6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Names. The functions of Part II begin with t2 (for Test 2) and keep the \
names of the original functions, written in the style of the Wolfram Language \
(for example the Rust function ",
 StyleBox["model::gamma_ch",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " is ",
 StyleBox["t2gammaCh",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "). Indices keep the values of the physics: the space-time index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["p", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1573f682-7ccd-4c3c-9853-06d18e06f407"],
 " runs over 0, 1, 2, 3, the space index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["j", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d2539ec-6448-4022-b5c9-6a95436a0a0e"],
 " and the isospin index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Iota]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "70c9e1e4-21cc-430b-8cb6-d6f56d0577a3"],
 " over 1, 2, 3. Wherever a result is shown, it is labelled with the \
registered symbol of Part I."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"115a5540-bfe7-4235-b302-40ce72e5dacd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Components of families. A component of a registered family, for example ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1c0034f5-c165-4b6a-a689-ae52eea2162f"],
 " of the family ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["p", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f9ffc91f-9415-465b-b872-9959c24ec77e"],
 ", is a symbol of its own, made from the box of the family with the index \
replaced by its value (function ",
 StyleBox["SL31Instance",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of Part I). It has to exist before a cell in which it is typed is \
evaluated: the front end sends the whole cell to the kernel, which reads all \
of it before it evaluates the first line, and a component box that is not yet \
symbolized is read as an ordinary expression (for example ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07c77cd5-5132-4a8e-b078-751d1145a558"],
 " as the power 0 of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1fe190ec-b706-4da5-a7e3-07e7fb8e78e8"],
 ", which is 1). The builder of the notebook collects every component that is \
typed anywhere in the notebook, and the next cell makes those that Part I has \
not made already; the check T2-SYM verifies that every one of them is read as \
one atomic symbol."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d2fc6fa7-0856-46d8-9d49-08e4bc081f88"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "components", " ", "typed", " ", "in", " ", "the", " ", 
     "notebook"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"as", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"TeX", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "family"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"index", " ", "->", " ", "value"}], ",", " ", "..."}], 
       "}"}]}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "list", " ", "is", " ", "written", " ", "here", " ", "by", "\n",
       "   ", "the", " ", "builder"}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "which", " ", "collects", " ", "it", " ", "from", " ", "the", " ", 
     "source", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "notebook"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"t2componentSpecs", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\sigma^{\\\\rm LL}_j\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<j\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<1\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\sigma^{\\\\rm LL}_j\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<j\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<2\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\sigma^{\\\\rm LL}_j\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<j\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<3\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\sigma^{\\\\rm LL}_j\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<j\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<0\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\gamma^p_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<0\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\gamma^p_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<1\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\gamma^p_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<2\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\gamma^p_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<3\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\mathsf A_{{\\\\rm LL},p}\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<j\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<q^j_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<j\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<1\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<x^p_{\\\\rm LL}\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<0\>\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
      "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"their", " ", "boxes"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "made", " ", "exactly", " ", "as", " ", "the", " ", "builder", " ", 
      "made", " ", "the", " ", "boxes", " ", "in", " ", "the", " ", "input", " ",
       "cells"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"t2componentBoxes", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Apply", "[", 
         RowBox[{"SL31`Build`symbolBoxes", ",", " ", "#"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}],
        ",", " ", "t2componentSpecs"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "a", " ", "component", " ", "that", " ", "is", " ", "already", " ", "a", " ",
      "symbol", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"made", " ", "in", " ", "Part", " ", "I"}], ")"}], " ", "is", " ",
      "not", " ", "symbolized", " ", "again"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"t2componentNew", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
      RowBox[{"t2componentBoxes", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"!", " ", 
         RowBox[{"MatchQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"SL31SymbolOf", "[", "#", "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"HoldComplete", "[", "_Symbol", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], " ", 
        "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Scan", "[", 
     RowBox[{"SL31Symbolize", ",", " ", "t2componentNew"}], "]"}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "like", " ", "the", " ", "symbols", " ", "of", " ", "Part", " ", "I", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"section", " ", "I", ".6"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "every", " ", "component", " ", "prints", " ", "in", " ", 
      "TraditionalForm", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "the", " ", "form", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "labels", " ", "of", "\n",
          "   ", "graphics"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
        "from", " ", "which", " ", "TeXForm", " ", "is", " ", "made"}]}], 
       ")"}], " ", "as", " ", "its", " ", "box"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"not", " ", "as", " ", "its", " ", "internal", " ", "name"}], ";",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "a", " ", "component", " ", "without", " ", "a", " ", "usage", "\n", 
       "   ", "message", " ", "receives", " ", "one", " ", "that", " ", 
       "names", " ", "its", " ", "family", " ", "and", " ", "its", " ", 
       "index", " ", "values"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Scan", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{"spec", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"With", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"b", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Apply", "[", 
             RowBox[{"SL31`Build`symbolBoxes", ",", " ", "spec"}], "]"}]}], 
           "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
          RowBox[{"Replace", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"SL31SymbolOf", "[", "b", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"HoldComplete", "[", "s_Symbol", "]"}], " ", ":>", " ", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"MakeBoxes", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", "TraditionalForm"}], "]"}], " ", "=", 
                " ", "b"}], ";", "\n", "        ", 
               RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"!", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"StringQ", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"MessageName", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", "\"\<usage\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
                 ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"MessageName", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", "\"\<usage\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "=", 
                  " ", 
                  
                  RowBox[{"\"\<the component \>\"", " ", "<>", "\n", 
                   "           ", 
                   RowBox[{"StringRiffle", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"#", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<>", 
                    " ", "\"\< = \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"#", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Rest", "[", "spec", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                    " ", "\"\<, \>\""}], "]"}], " ", "<>", 
                   " ", "\"\< of the registered family \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
                   
                   RowBox[{"First", "[", "spec", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
              ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
      "t2componentSpecs"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"t2componentTeX", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Replace", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"SL31SymbolOf", "[", "#", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"HoldComplete", "[", "s_", "]"}], " ", ":>", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
            RowBox[{"TeXForm", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Unevaluated", "[", "s", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], 
        " ", "&"}], ",", " ", "t2componentBoxes"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"SL31Check", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<T2-SYM\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<every component of a registered family that is typed in an \
input cell of the notebook (collected from the source by the builder) is read \
as one atomic symbol, and its TeX is written from its printed form, without \
the internal name\>\"", ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
       RowBox[{"t2componentBoxes", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"MatchQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"SL31SymbolOf", "[", "#", "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"HoldComplete", "[", "_Symbol", "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
         "&"}]}], "]"}], " ", "&&", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
       RowBox[{"t2componentTeX", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"!", " ", 
          RowBox[{"StringContainsQ", "[", 
           RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", 
            
            RowBox[{"\"\<UnderBracket\>\"", " ", "|", 
             " ", "\"\<\[UnderBracket]\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], " ", "&"}]}], 
       "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "t2componentBoxes", "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\< components, \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "t2componentNew", "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\< of them made here; their TeX: \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"StringRiffle", "[", 
         RowBox[{"t2componentTeX", ",", " ", "\"\<, \>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"32c608c5-3a95-4a7e-96fe-\
317c0d9f4a0b"],

Cell["\<\
Numbers. The original programs compute in double precision with random \
numbers from a generator with a fixed seed. Part II uses the same generator \
with the same seeds, and draws the random numbers in the same order, so that \
every random matrix, field and momentum is the same number as in the original \
program. Exact quantities (the Dirac matrices, the generators) are computed \
exactly; results that depend on rounding (the largest deviation of a check) \
are reported next to the value of the original report.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5782a760-f9f8-44dd-82f8-116349625ee7"],

Cell["\<\
II.1 The core library t2core: random numbers, matrices, the super-loop \
operators, the lattice\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"630883d8-4d19-49a5-a0b8-adc6c063bfbe"],

Cell["II.1.1 Random numbers (t2core/src/rng.rs)", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"f94f85c1-a19f-40f3-b4f6-9b214d025278"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The generator SplitMix64 keeps one unsigned 64-bit integer as its state. \
Every call adds the constant 9E3779B97F4A7C15 (hexadecimal) to the state and \
mixes the result with shifts, exclusive-or operations (",
 StyleBox["BitXor",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ") and multiplications; all arithmetic is modulo ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["2", "64"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dce050a6-b1a9-4f3f-9d8c-7606ab0a6be6"],
 ", as in Rust. A uniform number in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"[", 
    RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1", ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "835fd564-61af-425c-b6f2-9dee0270c84f"],
 " is made from the upper 53 bits. The conversion is exact in both languages, \
so the Wolfram Language reproduces every random number of the original \
programs bit for bit. The test compares the first three integers and the \
first four uniform numbers for the seed 2026111707 (the seed of the program \
t2_fields) with the values of the same algorithm computed independently in \
Python 3."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"57d1843b-db00-4204-a52c-30440dfdbbd0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"the", " ", "state", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "generator"}], ";",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2Seed", "[", "s", "]"}], " ", "starts", " ", "a", " ", "new", " ",
      "sequence"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2Seed", "[", "s_Integer", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"t2rngState", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
        RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", "^", "64"}]}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", 
    RowBox[{" ", 
     RowBox[{"one", " ", "step", " ", "of", " ", 
      RowBox[{"SplitMix64", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{"returns", " ", "an", " ", "integer", " ", 
        RowBox[{"in", " ", "[", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"2", "^", "64"}]}]}]}]}]}], ")"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2NextU64", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", "z", "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"t2rngState", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"t2rngState", " ", "+", " ", "16^^9E3779B97F4A7C15"}], ",",
            " ", 
           RowBox[{"2", "^", "64"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"z", " ", "=", " ", "t2rngState"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"z", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"BitXor", "[", 
             RowBox[{"z", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"BitShiftRight", "[", 
               RowBox[{"z", ",", " ", "30"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
            "16^^BF58476D1CE4E5B9"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"2", "^", "64"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"z", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"BitXor", "[", 
             RowBox[{"z", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"BitShiftRight", "[", 
               RowBox[{"z", ",", " ", "27"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
            "16^^94D049BB133111EB"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"2", "^", "64"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"BitXor", "[", 
         RowBox[{"z", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"BitShiftRight", "[", 
           RowBox[{"z", ",", " ", "31"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{" ", 
       RowBox[{"a", " ", "uniform", " ", "number", " ", 
        RowBox[{"in", " ", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "1"}]}]}], ")"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"the", " ", "upper", " ", "53", " ", "bits"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"as", " ", "an", " ", "exact", " ", "rational"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"converted", " ", "to", " ", "a", " ", "double"}]}], " ", "*)"}],
    "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2Unit", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"N", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"BitShiftRight", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"t2NextU64", "[", "]"}], ",", " ", "11"}], "]"}], "/", 
         RowBox[{"2", "^", "53"}]}]}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{" ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"a", " ", "random", " ", "complex", " ", "number", " ", "re"}],
        " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "i", " ", "im", " ", "with", " ", "re", " ", "and", " ", "im", " ", 
        "uniform", " ", 
        RowBox[{"in", " ", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "1"}]}]}]}], ")"}], " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"re", " ", "is", " ", "drawn", " ", "first"}], ")"}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2UnitC", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"re", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"t2Unit", "[", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"re", " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"I", " ", 
         RowBox[{"t2Unit", "[", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "a", " ", "list", " ", "of", " ", "n", " ", "random", " ", "complex", " ",
      "numbers"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2RndVec", "[", "n_Integer", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"t2UnitC", "[", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", "n", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"the", " ", 
      RowBox[{"test", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "the", " ", "first", " ", "values", " ", "for", " ", "the", " ", 
        "seed", " ", "2026111707"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "computed", " ", "by", " ", "the", " ", "same", " ", "algorithm", " ", 
      "in", " ", "Python", " ", "3"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"t2Seed", "[", "2026111707", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"t2first", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"t2NextU64", "[", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"t2NextU64", "[", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"t2NextU64", "[", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"t2Seed", "[", "2026111707", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"t2firstUnits", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"t2Unit", "[", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", "4", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"SL31Check", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<T2-RNG\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<the generator SplitMix64 gives, for the seed 2026111707, the \
integers and the uniform numbers of the original algorithm\>\"", ",", "\n", 
     "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"t2first", " ", "===", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "16253586484067153034", ",", " ", "11771902715344777314", ",", " ", 
         "8742176756923514478"}], "}"}]}], " ", "&&", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"t2firstUnits", " ", "===", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "0.7622173776706638", ",", " ", "0.2763122498264816", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"-", "0.05217129678912458"}], ",", " ", 
         "0.4038650534416697"}], "}"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", "t2firstUnits"}],
     "]"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"9a450901-07f1-4d34-80fa-\
37fe84765fe8"],

Cell["\<\
II.1.2 Complex numbers and matrices (t2core/src/c64.rs and cmat.rs)\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"8886f52f-2f78-4938-8528-9d84f888e266"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The Rust library defines its own complex numbers (c64.rs) and dense complex \
matrices (cmat.rs). The Wolfram Language has both built in: a complex number \
is ",
 StyleBox["a + I b",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; a matrix is a list of rows; ",
 StyleBox[".",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " (Dot) is the matrix product, ",
 StyleBox["ConjugateTranspose",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " the Hermitian conjugate, ",
 StyleBox["KroneckerProduct",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " the Kronecker product with the same index convention as the library (every \
entry of the product is the product of one entry of the first matrix and one \
entry of the second; its row is the pair of their rows and its column the \
pair of their columns, the row or column of the first matrix being the slower \
of the two), ",
 StyleBox["Tr",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " the trace and ",
 StyleBox["Norm[m, \"Frobenius\"]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " the Frobenius norm. Three routines of cmat.rs are rewritten here because \
the programs and their checks use them: the inverse of a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9dbb2f0a-2ccb-463d-926d-94e3223f8be8"],
 " matrix by its explicit formula, the matrix exponential by scaling and \
squaring of the Taylor series, and the Hermitian eigensolver."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"badf3e72-2f10-47d1-8e29-fa9ae6613898"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "determinant", " ", "and", " ", "the", " ", "inverse", " ", 
     "of", " ", "a", " ", "2", " ", "x", " ", "2", " ", "matrix"}], ",", " ", 
    
    RowBox[{"by", " ", "the", " ", "explicit", " ", "formulas", " ", "of", " ", 
     RowBox[{"cmat", ".", "rs"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2det2", "[", "m_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"m", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"m", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"m", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"m", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2inv2", "[", "m_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"d", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"t2det2", "[", "m", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"m", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"-", 
             RowBox[{"m", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
          " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", 
             RowBox[{"m", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", 
               RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"m", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "/",
         "d"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "principal", " ", "square", " ", "root", " ", "of", " ", "a",
       " ", "complex", " ", "number"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"as", " ", "in", " ", 
      RowBox[{"c64", ".", 
       RowBox[{"rs", ":", " ", 
        RowBox[{"|", "z", "|", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"^", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], ")"}]}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"cos", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"arg", " ", 
               RowBox[{"z", "/", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
            RowBox[{"i", " ", "sin", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"arg", " ", 
               RowBox[{"z", "/", "2"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]}]}]}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2csqrt", "[", "z_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "z", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"th", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Arg", "[", "z", "]"}], "/", "2"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"r", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "th", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"I", " ", "r", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "th", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "matrix", " ", "exponential", " ", "of", " ", 
      RowBox[{"cmat", ".", 
       RowBox[{"rs", ":", " ", 
        RowBox[{
        "halve", " ", "the", " ", "matrix", " ", "until", " ", "its", " ", 
         "Frobenius", " ", "norm", " ", "is", " ", "at", " ", "most", " ", 
         RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}]}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sum", "\n", "   ", "the", " ", "Taylor", " ", "series", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"at", " ", "most", " ", "29", " ", "terms"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
         "stopping", " ", "when", " ", "a", " ", "term", " ", "is", " ", 
          "smaller", " ", "than", " ", "1", "e"}], "-", "18"}]}], ")"}]}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "then", " ", "square", " ", "the", "\n", "   ", "result", " ", "as", " ",
       "often", " ", "as", " ", "the", " ", "matrix", " ", "was", " ", 
      "halved"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2expm", "[", "m_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "m", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"nrm", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
           RowBox[{"m", ",", " ", "\"\<Frobenius\>\""}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"s", " ", "=", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"scale", " ", "=", " ", "1."}], ",", " ", "x", ",", " ", 
         "term", ",", " ", "sum"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"While", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"nrm", " ", "scale"}], " ", ">", " ", "0.25"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"scale", " ", "*=", " ", "0.5"}], ";", " ", 
           RowBox[{"s", "++"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"x", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"scale", " ", "m"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"term", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "n", "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"sum", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "n", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"term", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"term", " ", ".", " ", "x"}], "/", "k"}]}], ";", " ", 
           RowBox[{"sum", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"sum", " ", "+", " ", "term"}]}], ";", " ", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
               RowBox[{"term", ",", " ", "\"\<Frobenius\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "<",
               " ", "1*^-18"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Break", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "29"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sum", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"sum", " ", ".", " ", "sum"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "s", "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", "sum"}]}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"57d4c425-0d09-4a1b-a9b0-\
53cb7b924aab"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The Hermitian eigensolver ",
 StyleBox["eigh",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of cmat.rs finds all eigenvalues and eigenvectors of a complex Hermitian \
matrix (called ",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " in the code) in two stages. (1) Householder reduction: for every column ",
 StyleBox["k",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " a reflection (the unit matrix minus twice the projector on a complex unit \
vector ",
 StyleBox["vv",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ") is chosen that sets to zero all entries of the column below the \
subdiagonal; applied from both sides it keeps the eigenvalues and turns ",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " step by step into a tridiagonal matrix, and the product of the reflections \
is accumulated in the matrix ",
 StyleBox["q",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". The complex subdiagonal entries are then made real and non-negative by a \
diagonal unitary matrix of phases. (2) The implicit QL algorithm with \
Wilkinson shifts: plane rotations, applied to the real symmetric tridiagonal \
matrix, drive its off-diagonal entries to zero; the diagonal then holds the \
eigenvalues, and the accumulated rotations, multiplied by ",
 StyleBox["q",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", give the eigenvectors. The function below follows the Rust code step by \
step (the indices are shifted by one, because lists of the Wolfram Language \
begin at position 1); the vector operations of the Wolfram Language replace \
the inner loops."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dbf8da69-7dfe-4c67-992d-60edf8d10492"],

