     " ", "\"\<the self-consistency of the mean field: for the polar order \
parameter the sum over the eight positive-energy eigenvectors of psi_p^T \
Kch_3 conj(psi_h) equals -2 Delta (1/E^+ + 1/E^-), so that the mode-sum form \
of the mean-field equations gives the gap equation 1/G = int d^3q/(2 pi)^3 \
(1/E^+ + 1/E^-) (30 random momenta; tolerance 1e-10)\>\"", ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"worstGap", " ", "<", " ", "1*^-10"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
