   RowBox[{"SL31Check", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<T2-DATA-1\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<the numbers of the figures agree with the data files written \
by the original program t2_fields: the 48 eigenvalues of the lattice operator \
and the 802 points of the curves of Figure 1 (tolerance 5.1e-11, half a unit \
of the last printed decimal); the file of the integrations by CVODE of Figure \
2 has the 41 output times of GS-13 (tolerance 5.1e-5), and its relative \
deviations from the exact solution are below 1e-13 at x_LL^0 = 0, stay below \
1e-9 for rtol = 1e-12, and their largest values decrease from rtol = 1e-8 to \
1e-10 to 1e-12, as the original check GS-13 states\>\"", ",", "\n", "  ", 
